### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### REQUEST TRANSACTIONS WORKFLOW - Transaction System
### Base Route: api/RequestTransactions
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7010
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Q2jA5PJdQpjOZ9F0wnU_2GCorgyE4UQlEIGWMeofAmQ

@transactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@parentTransactionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@requestId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. GET TRANSACTION BY ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. GET TRANSACTIONS BY REQUEST ID
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/by-request/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. GET CHILD TRANSACTIONS
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/{{parentTransactionId}}/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. GET ROOT TRANSACTION FOR REQUEST
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/root/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. GET TRANSACTION TREE
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/{{transactionId}}/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. CREATE INITIAL TRANSACTION (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="RequestId"

{{requestId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Notes"

Initial transaction notes
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="supporting-doc.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./supporting-doc.pdf
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. ADD CHILD TRANSACTION (multipart/form-data)
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/AddTransactionChildren
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ParentTransactionId"

{{parentTransactionId}}
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Notes"

Child transaction notes
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Files"; filename="additional-doc.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./additional-doc.pdf
------Boundary--

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. GET PAGED TRANSACTIONS BY STATUS
### TransactionStatus: 0=Pending, 1=InProgress, 2=Completed, etc.
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/paged?status=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. MARK REQUEST AS MANAGED
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/RequestTransactions/{{requestId}}/mark-as-managed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
